        <Param val="Welcome, and thank you for taking part.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this task, a shape will appear in the centre of the screen.&amp;#10;Sometimes other shapes will appear on either side of it.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Your job is to respond ONLY to the centre shape and ignore the others.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If the centre shape is  ▲  or  ●   press the  A  key.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If the centre shape is  ■  or  ◆   press the  L  key.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Keep your eyes on the + in the middle of the screen.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Respond as quickly and as accurately as you can.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to begin." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
